WEBVTT

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:20.320
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:08.000
huff
puff

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:14.070
Wool! Wool! Wool! Wool!

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:16.940
Soumei-san?

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:17.530
Teary-eyed

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.610
What's the matter?
Teary-eyed

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:19.200
Teary-eyed

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:26.870
You want to go for a walk?

00:02:30.570 --> 00:02:31.290
Go ahead.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:49.600
Meeting Room

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:53.710
Yata! Could you get the humidifier?

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.720
Haruka-san is starting to crack.

00:03:02.650 --> 00:03:05.170
Nacchan!

00:03:05.170 --> 00:03:07.660
No sexual harassment via
Yataro's body allowed!

00:03:07.660 --> 00:03:08.550
Oh, it's fine.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:09.360
Stop it!
Oh, it's fine.

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:09.810
Yataro loves you, too, Nacchan!
Stop it!

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:12.090
Yataro loves you, too, Nacchan!

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:13.790
It's not fine! Stop it!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:16.960
Oh, it's you, Soumei-san.
I thought it was noisy.

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:19.720
I see you've come back
to life, Haruka.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.940
I feel sick.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:24.310
Soumei-san's sound is mixing
in with Yata's sound,

00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:25.760
and it's really disgusting.

00:03:26.240 --> 00:03:27.750
Get a hold of yourself, Haruka-san!

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:30.020
I guess being brilliant comes
with its hardships.

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.390
You smell so good...

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.190
I told you to hold on to this

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.990
since that smell fetishist
hates the smell of garlic.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:41.160
He's totally Dracula...

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:43.110
Hey, Perv.

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:47.520
Stop messing around in Yata's body
and get back into the sheep.

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:49.350
Not okay with a sexual
harassment loving boss!

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.540
Why are you so cold to me?!

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:55.040
This guy is obsessed with lolis,
a smell fetishist, and a total weirdo!

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:57.540
Don't compare him to you!

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.300
Yataro is a closet perv!

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.350
Perverted kids with no
self-control need to go away!

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:05.100
Hey! Stop that! I'm not a bug!

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.750
This body may be temporary,
but I'm your boss!

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:07.940
I'm special!

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.310
You mean you're a perv.

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:13.720
That's the problem
with kids these days.

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.190
They don't know real work.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:16.560
Where are you going?

00:04:17.780 --> 00:04:19.440
The Inaba Detective Agency.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:26.030
Why's he going so early?

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.390
It's still only 7 AM.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:30.550
Old-timers sure have a lot of
energy so early in the morning.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.000
He's sleeping with his glasses on!

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:42.180
I do that at times, as well.
Accidentally.

00:04:42.460 --> 00:04:44.560
Oh, really?

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.120
Wait! I mean, why's he sleeping here?!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.220
Uh, yeah, that!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:52.680
He's trespassing.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.900
But something's different about him.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:04:59.210
It's like he's someone else.

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:02.190
You say that, but we have no idea
what you're talking about.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.540
I'll give him a poke.

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:07.990
Something came out?!

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:17.270
I don't think he has any
idea what's going on.

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:20.170
I'll give you some beef jerky,
so put those dangerous things away.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:22.050
You don't need to be scared.

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:25.810
What's the matter? Are you lost?

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:27.320
I wonder if he'll drink milk.

00:05:27.320 --> 00:05:29.090
It's like they picked up a stray dog...

00:05:29.660 --> 00:05:31.340
Don't you talk?

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.680
Seems he's not allowed to speak
out of turn, since he's a vessel.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:35.830
Haruka!

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:38.440
If you're back to normal,
then come home, you idiot.

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:40.350
You're too quick to take
food from strangers.

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.660
Thanks for taking care of Yataro.

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:46.020
All because of the annoying old man.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:47.620
Old man?

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:49.660
Where are you, Soumei-san?

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:50.350
Wait, what's going on?

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.990
Please come out!
Wait, what's going on?

00:05:58.760 --> 00:06:00.330
That startled me.

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:02.990
I thought I was going to
pass on to the next world.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:03.670
You totally should.

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.000
He's not very cute when he speaks.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.280
The one speaking is Soumei-san.

00:06:08.280 --> 00:06:09.720
He's possessing Yataro.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.180
Stop referring to me like
I'm some evil ghost.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.280
But you basically are.

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.890
Haruka, what's going on?

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:21.060
Long, long ago,

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:24.300
specifically about thirty years ago,

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:28.130
there were many Secret Dobermans
in the Japanese police force.

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.580
But one particular police dog

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.900
surpassed the squad in investigative
skill and cohesive power,

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:36.130
and was even regarded
as dangerous to the public.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.580
That charismatic leader was
our boss, Soumei-san.

00:06:39.060 --> 00:06:39.830
Boss?

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:42.720
Unlike the others, he was able to use

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.100
special powers when the moon was full.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.170
Isn't that normal?
You mean not everyone can?

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:49.460
Oh, you didn't know?

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:51.580
Apparently, not everyone can.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.540
Only us.

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:54.470
Oh.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:56.870
So, on nights of the full moon,

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:59.560
Soumei-san can leave
his body in spirit form

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:02.350
and become a free black wolf.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:05.350
However, he has to return to his body

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:07.670
on another full moon night,
or he can't rejoin his body,

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.820
and his spirit energy is slowly depleted.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:14.320
That's why Soumei-san is

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:17.030
currently surviving by using
other people's bodies.

00:07:17.920 --> 00:07:20.910
So he's still alive in spirit form?

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:23.850
So all he has to do is return
to his own body, right?

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.070
Right?

00:07:25.450 --> 00:07:26.880
Where's his body?

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:28.000
That's right!

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.670
There's a reason he can't
return to his own body!

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:34.050
He's been imprisoned for a
crime he did not commit!

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.650
A crime he didn't commit?

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:36.350
Yes.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.900
A police inspector he didn't get along with

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:41.150
mysteriously committed suicide
on a night with a full moon.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.600
So it was suspected that
Soumei-san possessed him

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:43.920
and made him do it.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:44.740
Confess, you will.
and made him do it.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:45.330
Confess, you will.

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:47.110
You did it, didn't you?

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.150
The ones who were enraged
by this were the

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:52.710
Secret Dobermans who looked up to him.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.550
They all decided they would leave.

00:07:56.440 --> 00:07:57.220
Get 'em!

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.270
It couldn't be helped, considering
the police cut off Soumei-san so easily,

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.640
despite how hard he had worked for them.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:10.090
On a night with a full moon,
as Soumei-san left his body,

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.430
the Secret Dobermans left the police.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.660
And that eventually led to
the formation of NORA.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:21.040
Now, let's get down to business.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:24.310
Hiroshi, I have a job for
you as a detective.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:28.900
Look for my body that the police
are holding somewhere.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.690
They probably got rid of it
by now, don't you think?

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.160
I assume that, if my body were gone,

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.180
my spirit form wouldn't last this long.

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:38.990
Though I can't be sure
since I've never died.

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:43.130
But you happen to be proof
of what my body is worth.

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:46.250
Those jerks thought they could do
as they pleased with an empty shell.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:50.480
Hiroshi, you were born through
artificial insemination, right?

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.630
What of it?

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:57.680
No matter how you look at it,
they used my DNA.

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:00.180
Hiroshi,

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:03.440
you're my son.

00:09:05.860 --> 00:09:06.940
That can't be...

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:09.360
As proof of that, you can use special

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.760
powers on nights with a full moon, right?

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:13.740
You, me, and Haruka.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.940
Aren't you happy, Nii-ni?

00:09:18.510 --> 00:09:20.310
Weren't you always curious about that?

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.500
What's the matter, Hiroshi?

00:09:23.830 --> 00:09:25.570
I'm your father. Your father!

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:27.160
Who are you calling my father?

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:28.930
I told you, it's me.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.420
Congratulations, Nii-ni. Your dream...

00:09:34.150 --> 00:09:36.330
How's that, Hiroshi?

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:38.320
Your stubble tickles.

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.340
...can come true now.

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:42.590
That was when I was a kid!

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:45.600
Really?! That's all you
want from your father?!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.100
So, I'm counting on you to find my body.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:52.380
Whatever!
As if I'd accept a job from you!

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.700
Of course, I'm arresting you!

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:56.890
Apparently, you're in your
rebellious stage...

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.130
Well, whatever.

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:00.110
Come at me.

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:03.490
I'll show you why they
called me the Black Fang.

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:05.800
The Black Fang?

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:09.230
Sounds like a plain ol' cavity to me.

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:11.170
Brush your teeth, Pops.

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:14.090
Show your charismatic father
some respect, you idiot sons!

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:16.840
You don't have a choice in this!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:17.800
Right.

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.500
Cuticle Bolt!

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:21.800
I should have seen that coming!

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:24.330
I'm sure you were old thirty years ago.
Yata!

00:10:24.330 --> 00:10:25.770
You've got some energy for an old man.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:27.060
You're so cool, Nii-Ni.

00:10:27.280 --> 00:10:31.610
No kidding. You look as cool
as I do when you transform.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:32.910
Kei!

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.780
It's your papa!

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:36.790
What's going on, Haruka?

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:39.610
Hm? I told you that Yataro
was just a vessel.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:42.850
I can't talk without borrowing
someone else's body.

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.370
However, to avoid any more
confusion from my comrades,

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.580
I usually only borrow Yataro.

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:50.980
If there are humans who
allow me in like Yataro,

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:53.250
I can recover some of my
energy while inside them.

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:56.900
Plus, I won't die if the body I'm in is harmed.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:10:58.510
Wh-What?

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:01.090
I'm saying that this is possible, too.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.050
Don't!

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:05.290
Hurry up and find my body already.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:07.140
I'll be borrowing this body until the—

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.600
What do you think you're doing, pe—

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.190
Pe? Pe...

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.380
Pe, pe, pe, pe, pe, pe...

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:17.950
Persian!

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:19.260
Welcome back, Kei.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:20.360
Huh? What?!

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:24.160
I was finally able to find one with
fur worthy of my hair fetish.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:26.670
I was going to give it
to you as a bonus.

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:29.450
Look. The fur is just like a real one!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:32.830
Oh, it's so light and fluffy,
almost as if it were silk!

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:34.720
What kind of mental power

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.360
does that kid have to be
able to kick me out?

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:37.380
I underestimated him.

00:11:37.730 --> 00:11:38.410
Then...

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:40.800
I'll just have to take
this assistant hostage!

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:53.020
His energy depleted to
the size of a chihuahua!

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:05.320
So that's the deal.
I'm counting on you!

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:06.450
See ya!

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:09.080
Hey! Don't run away!

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.850
Do you think your brother
will find the body for us?

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:14.540
He probably will.
I'm sure he's curious.

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.680
I'd like to free Yataro
as soon as possible.

00:12:19.310 --> 00:12:22.550
Don't be fooled, Nacchan!
He's a wolf, too!

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:25.250
Shut up. Brush your teeth, Black Fang.

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.710
I'll be mad if you give Yataro cavities!

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:29.380
And I'm telling you it's not a cavity!

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.470
Think of it as a banana in the refriger—

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.010
Wait!

00:12:31.010 --> 00:12:33.690
Aw, come on! Stop! Hey!

00:12:37.010 --> 00:12:40.110
- 5/27 -
Extra

00:12:42.340 --> 00:12:43.070
Yeah,

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.260
I don't think I'll be able
to go home tonight.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.140
Thanks. Good night.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.320
Not that I'm at an age to celebrate it,

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.520
but it'd be nice to be able
to go home on my birthday.

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:00.970
I had to work when I turned
twenty-seven, too.

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.120
Though Hiroshi was still
with me at that time.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.520
Ogi! We're gonna eat cake!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:08.980
Hiroshi?

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:11.370
Yes?

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:17.910
Bwahaha

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:21.830
Happy birthday,
Kuniharu Big Three-O-gino.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.530
Don't give me a weird middle name.
You're close to my age.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:28.070
What do you want?

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:30.640
Don't ask things you already
know the answer to.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:31.100
29 Years Old

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:33.500
This young and fresh man in
his twenties came to laugh

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:34.870
at the old man in his thirties.

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:35.310
30 Years Old

00:13:35.310 --> 00:13:36.080
Go home.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:39.780
You may be working,
but you have time to eat cake.

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:40.940
I brought you one.

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:43.580
I'm surprised you remembered.

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.420
I'm pretty diligent, aren't I?

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.670
That's why I'm popular.

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.340
Don't flatter yourself.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:52.360
You're thirty, so I got three
big candles for your cake.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.130
Thirty! Thirty! Thirty...

00:13:53.130 --> 00:13:54.770
You even prepared candles?
Thirty! Thirty! Thirty...

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:57.370
Happy birthday, dear Thirty...

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.190
Thirty
Happy birthday, dear Thirty...

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:02.020
What the hell did you just light?
Thirty

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:06.990
Hurry and blow it out, or you'll die!

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:13.590
I'm pretty sure that I'll live
through a dynamite blast...

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:15.790
What about you?

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:18.370
Oh, crap! I'm the only one in trouble!

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:19.660
This may be too much to ask,

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:21.520
but would you pwease blow these out?

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:25.410
Happy Birthday
Thirty

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:29.220
Since you're thirty now, it means
that we met twelve years ago.

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:33.570
A baby born twelve years ago
would be in middle school now.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:35.140
A lot can happen in that time.

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:36.980
Yeah, a lot did happen.

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.230
You should head back to see
your family once in a while.

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:42.530
Your mom said that she wanted to
take pictures of her granddaughter.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:46.780
Sounds like your dad's liver isn't
in good condition, either.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:50.410
Why do you know more about
my parents than I do?

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:51.950
Your mom still sends me pictures

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.010
Siberian Husky
Your mom still sends me pictures

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:52.290
Goro-chan

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:54.330
of Goro-chan every once in a while.

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:54.830
Siberian Husky
Goro-chan

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:57.520
Now that I think about it,
you used to hang out

00:14:57.520 --> 00:14:59.250
at my house all the
time because of my dog.

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:03.040
On top of that, she sends me
rice, pickles, and beer.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.630
She's treating you better
than her own son!

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:08.610
Why are you so close with my parents?

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:11.640
Because you never brought any
other friends to their place.

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:15.350
They even told me about
your weakness...

00:15:17.510 --> 00:15:19.350
Apparently, you completely suck

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:22.410
at the game, "look over there!"

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.060
How about we go a round?

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.990
What are we, children?

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:27.750
All right, let's do this.

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:34.990
Paper, rock,

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:35.610
scissors!

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:37.070
Look over there!

00:15:38.030 --> 00:15:39.500
Paper, rock, scissors!

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:41.210
Look over there!

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:42.920
Paper, rock, scissors!

00:15:43.220 --> 00:15:43.880
...scissors!

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:52.930
...scissors!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.010
Win, already!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:57.390
Shut up! You need to lose!

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:00.100
This is stupid.

00:16:00.340 --> 00:16:02.560
Wow, it's so late already.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:05.820
I'm gonna go home.
Here's your gift, before I go.

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:08.860
Don't worry about it.
You've done enough.

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:10.770
This is Yuzu King telling you
that you've received a text.

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:13.990
Hurry up and reply,
thirty-year-oldie Kuniharumba.

00:16:14.360 --> 00:16:16.510
Hear my voice every
time you get a text.

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:18.000
What the hell is that annoyance?!

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:21.670
Damn it. Where do I change this?

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:22.040
This is Yuzu King telling you that
you've received a text...

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:24.960
Don't send me a text!
Let me change the settings!

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.020
Farewell, Thirty!

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:29.410
Hey! Don't run away!

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:32.210
You'll get the next Yuzuki
surprise in ten years!

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:33.130
Change the settings before
you go, damn it!

00:16:33.130 --> 00:16:35.330
This is Yuzu King telling you
that you've received a text.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.820
Hurry up and reply,
thirty-year-oldie Kuniharumba.
Stop texting me!

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:38.330
Hurry up and reply,
thirty-year-oldie Kuniharumba.

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:40.020
In ten years?

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:44.100
Come to think of it, he visited me
on my twentieth birthday, too.

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.900
Hey, new adult!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.600
I'll celebrate 'til you're a hundred!

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:55.680
Is that idiot going to repeat this
harassment every ten years?

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:56.560
This is Yuzu King telling you
that you've received a text.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:57.760
Damn it, not again!

00:16:57.760 --> 00:17:00.740
Hurry up and reply,
thirty-year-oldie Kuniharumba.

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.890
Well, whatever.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:11.780
This is Yuzu King telling you
that you've received a text.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:14.580
Hurry up and reply,
thirty-year-oldie Kuniharumba.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:16.120
Inaba Detective Agency

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.800
Look over...
Inaba Detective Agency

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.470
Look over...

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.340
there.

00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:24.810
It's true! You totally suck at this!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.100
I wanna play, too!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.740
Let me have a turn, too!

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:28.680
This is hilarious.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:29.650
Why...

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:29.920
This is hilarious.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:33.320
Extra

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.580
The Wolf's House!

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:36.110
Extra

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:39.390
Long, long ago,

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.200
there lived a wolf family.

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.630
There was the impatient older brother,

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:45.590
the carefree younger brother,

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:48.920
the responsible older sister,
and the pampered little sister.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:51.100
Then, there was the silent middle child

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.710
and the competent father.

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.210
They all lived happily together.

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:56.630
Cat Boxer

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.890
You smell like an old man, Yataro!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.760
Dirty! Dirty!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.560
Stop picking on him!

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.730
I'll clean you off.

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:05.190
Wipe, wipe. Wipe, wipe

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:07.320
Dirty! Dirty!
Wipe, wipe. Wipe, wipe

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:07.700
I said, stop picking on him! Hey!

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:08.920
Dirty! Dirty!

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:10.240
Hey, you guys...

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:11.480
Dirty! Dirty!

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:13.230
One day...

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:16.110
All right, I'm off to work.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.740
All right! We get goat meat tonight!

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:20.540
I want to eat a yummy one!

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:22.600
Get us a jiggly one!

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.550
Jiggly, pretty please.

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:26.120
Hey, now, calm down.

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:27.920
You're all going, too.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:32.500
One day, you're going to leave
the nest and work on your own.

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:35.840
You all should watch me work
and learn for yourselves.

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:37.800
Yeah! Independence!

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.300
What a relief!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.510
So we don't have to see
your face anymore?

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:43.980
Calm down, you stupid brats!

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:50.450
Papa's job is to apprehend bad goats.

00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.850
Bad goats?

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:55.430
Bad goats are bad because
they ignore the laws

00:18:55.430 --> 00:18:57.950
of the forest and eat trees
all the way to their roots.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:02.390
Roots are the best!

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:04.400
This is what it's about!

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:06.380
Others wouldn't get it.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.510
This is to prevent the forest
from turning into a desert.

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:12.450
No need to hold back.

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:13.750
Okay!

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:15.960
I'll go in from the front.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.840
You guys guard the windows
and the back door.

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:21.560
Man, working is so boring.

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.680
I don't want to be a grown-up.

00:19:25.090 --> 00:19:27.310
If they resist, you can eat them.

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.460
All right! Better watch out, goats!

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.980
The wolves of justice
are on their way!

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.710
You won't get away with this, goats!

00:19:38.950 --> 00:19:41.230
Yes? I wonder who it is, I do.

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:43.250
I think Mama is back.

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:44.390
I believe you're right, I do.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:45.410
It's the wolf!

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:51.900
Baa Baa

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:53.610
So, there you have it.
Baa Baa

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:55.240
Wow, that's easy.
Baa Baa

00:19:55.240 --> 00:19:56.750
Way to go, Papa!
Baa Baa

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.420
There seems to be one missing.
Did it run off?
Baa Baa

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.550
I'm going to go look for it.
Keep an eye on them.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:38.060
Well, well. What have you done
to my precious little babies?

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:43.220
Looks like I'm going to have
to punish you bad little wolves.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:49.140
I'll cut open your stomachs,

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:54.900
fill them with rocks,
and throw you into the well.

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:02.250
Wait!

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:16.520
Oh?

00:21:17.240 --> 00:21:18.880
Are you giving up already?

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.540
Papa!

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:26.520
Papa Punch!

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.810
Sorry about that.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.730
Papa!

00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.390
Oh, there, there.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:52.350
And they say that the wolf family
lived happily ever after.

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:53.510
The End

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:54.800
The End!
The End

00:21:54.800 --> 00:21:56.080
The End

00:23:26.520 --> 00:23:29.880
Onii-tan, how's the reception?

00:23:29.880 --> 00:23:30.750
Hello?
Onii-tan, how's the reception?

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:33.710
Sorry... I forgot to record Inaba.

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:38.090
My kid really wanted to
take a bath with me.

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:39.040
That's a lie.

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:41.270
Make sure you don't forget next week.
